# PROTECTION OF WOMEN

MAYOR OF BANDAR LAMPUNG

LAMPUNG PROVINCE

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF BANDAR LAMPUNG CITY

NUMBER 03 OF 2019

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF BANDAR LAMPUNG,

Considering:







a. that in order to fulfill the constitutional rights of women, every citizen has the right to be free from torture or treatment that degrades human dignity, has the right to obtain security and freedom from all forms of violence and to improve the quality of life of women which is one of the responsibilities of the Regional Government;
b. that in the effort to fulfill women's rights, efforts need to be made by families, communities, and the Regional Government, as referred to in letter a, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Protection of Women;

In View of:







1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 28 of 1959 concerning the Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 4 of 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1956 Number 55, Emergency Law Number 5 of 1956 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1956 Number 57) concerning the Establishment of Level II Regions Including Municipal Cities Within the Level I Region of South Sumatra as Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1959 Number 73, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1821);
